 The application will now be running on `http://localhost:11224`.
 
+## Agent tools
+
+The sign-in and sign-up forms expose the `sign-in` and `sign-up` WebMCP tools
+on their respective pages. Each tool takes the required `username` and `password`
+fields and uses the same client-side submission as the visible form. The browser
+keeps a user review step before submission; these account tools do not autosubmit.
+Agents receive the success or error message, without credentials or response tokens.
+
+These declarative tools require a browser with WebMCP form support. Other browsers
+ignore the tool attributes and retain the normal form behavior.
+
 ## Tech Stack
 
 - **[Astro](https://astro.build/)**: The web framework for building content-driven websites.
